      "content": "that's a good start, thanks. i think i want to dive deeper into the social democratic side for the second section of my paper. could you expand on the different nuances within social democratic thought? like, how do they actually reconcile individual rights with the idea of collective responsibility? i want to make sure i'm not just giving a surface level 'tax the rich' explanation, but actually capturing the complex moral justifications they use.",
